{
  "name": "Day 18 — Global Error Workflow → Telegram + Log",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 18: Global Error Workflow → Telegram + Log\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: Telegram bot token (BotFather se)\n- Connect: Google Sheets (Google OAuth)\n- Is workflow ko save karo (Active karne ki zaroorat nahi)\n- Har doosre workflow mein: Settings → Error Workflow → \"Day 18 — Global Error Workflow\" chuno\n- \"Errors\" tab headers: workflow, node, error, url, time\n\nCourse: Day 18 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "72685195-51b3-4588-a30d-b7908885777d",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "9a902cd8-ccbb-45f1-af12-271a2676c6c8",
      "name": "On Any Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "726ac7ad-61ed-4bb9-a54d-25ee7230cf15",
              "name": "workflow",
              "value": "={{ $json.workflow.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "54b60211-7301-4265-a05d-09911bfadd65",
              "name": "node",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.lastNodeExecuted }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f803977c-f87f-441a-afcb-a50186dae020",
              "name": "error",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.error.message }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ec6de320-8d06-44bf-a9f6-bd108cddd9ae",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "957ab8a9-ce9f-4471-a755-881b7ddea1ad",
              "name": "time",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7b252f8e-a530-473d-a9ae-5259a6d47e08",
      "name": "Error Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=🚨 Workflow failed!\n\n📦 {{ $json.workflow }}\n🧩 Node: {{ $json.node }}\n❌ {{ $json.error }}\n🕒 {{ $json.time }}\n🔗 {{ $json.url }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "e9e48d0e-9548-4320-ab0c-ea713c357f57",
      "name": "Telegram Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Errors",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a6bf5235-acf0-4f9c-a057-d49b5ca139c9",
      "name": "Error Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "On Any Error": {
      "main": [
        [
